HAMSPIRIT_PA_FAILED=Game Over: Power amplifier failed!
HAMSPIRIT_MATCHED=Perfect match! 50 Ohms resonance achieved.
HAMSPIRIT_RESONANCE=Antenna tuned to resonance!

