HAMSPIRIT_MORSE_AHEAD=Antenna ahead - send next character
HAMSPIRIT_MORSE_BEHIND=Antenna behind - send previous character
HAMSPIRIT_MORSE_COLLECTED=Character collected!
HAMSPIRIT_MORSE_BONUS=HAMSPIRIT bonus complete!

